  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{Mg}_3\\left(\\mathrm{PO}_4\\right)_2$\n'n' moles\n$8 \\mathrm{n}=0.25$\n$\\mathrm{n}=\\frac{0.25}{8}$\n$\\quad=\\frac{25}{8 \\times 100}=3.125 \\times 10^{-2}$"
